    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d169">

                <pb facs="0507" n="393" sameAs="frus:frus1943/pg393"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Roosevelt Papers: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President Roosevelt to Prime Minister Churchill
                        </hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d169-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">priority</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-07-16">July 16, 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Number 318 from the President to the Former Naval Person secret and personal.</p>
                <p>I have still heard nothing from U.J. I wired him yesterday and should have an
                    answer quickly. When I hear I will let you know at once about <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">Abraham</hi> and I like your suggested time.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Roosevelt</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d169-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d169-f1-content">
                <p>Sent to the United States Naval Attaché, London, via Navy channels.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
